\nカグラの顔に、アリスのフックが決まり吹きとばせれながらマウスピースを吐き出す。\n\n■シーン③\nカグラがダウンし、KO負けしてる姿をアリスが見下ろす。\n\n\n可能な限りで、描いてくださると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mevushbI1pBeq74vHBGp8Q71ZQch7VZa", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thomson/works/94", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4023b72b/uploads/origins/c572aa99-5c1a-4a9b-8365-8e7309b22132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b911e04f55fdd66664145d0358165767", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4023b72b/uploads/origins/c572aa99-5c1a-4a9b-8365-8e7309b22132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b911e04f55fdd66664145d0358165767, https://si.imgix.net/4023b72b/uploads/origins/c572aa99-5c1a-4a9b-8365-8e7309b22132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=393cae9b9bd7c5f90217ebb3ace9570e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4023b72b/uploads/origins/c572aa99-5c1a-4a9b-8365-8e7309b22132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b17947cfc537a461b00957875d900209 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thomson/works/93", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/161e2911/uploads/origins/96d33f3d-e074-4f5d-8ee3-f60f5eba0914?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3897dbbcc1c6aaee6a251d8cac701487", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/161e2911/uploads/origins/96d33f3d-e074-4f5d-8ee3-f60f5eba0914?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3897dbbcc1c6aaee6a251d8cac701487, https://